    "title": "'Unforgettable' string bikini-clad star flaunts tiny waist for 'SI' Swim - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Abby Tegnelia ,\n1 hours ago\nSports Illustrated swimsuit issue model Natalie Mariduena took South Florida by storm, showing off her flawless bikini body for a shoot that the iconic magazine deemed “unforgettable.”\nIn the chosen photo, Mariduena kneeled in the ocean, flaunting her tiny waist in a purple string bikini by Oseree, her stunning long hair blowing wild in the wind. She also wore earrings by Lili Claspe.\n“Hollywood, Fla could not have been a more perfect backdrop for Natalie Mariduena’s unforgettable SI Swimsuit feature,” SI Swim captioned the September 27 share on X (formerly Twitter).\nThe post also included a Sports Illustrated Swimsuit link to the model’s epic 2021 photo shoot, which included a few dozen photos from her Florida pictorial. In addition to the cheeky, barely-there string bikini, she showed off her physique in a hot pink two-piece by Andi Bagus and other fluorescent suits. In one pic, she used Floridian fronds as her backdrop as she modeled a blue Tori Praver Swimwear bikini. She also draped herself across a rock in a swimsuit by Myra Swim and necklace by Aureum Collective.\nMariduena was photographed by James Macari.\nThe model and influencer, 38, rose to fame via YouTuber David Dobrik and now boasts almost 3 million followers on Instagram and more than 3 million on TikTok.\nRead More!\nLivvy Dunne flexes chiseled gymnast’s bod in sizzling ‘SI’ Swim throwback\nJon Rahm’s gorgeous wife stuns in cleavage-baring, semi-sheer gown\nSophie Cunningham dances in low-cut robe, fit to hype up for Game Day",
